ref.description:
This agent specializes in the organization's product recommendations and offerings. It performs hybrid search (semantic + keyword) to help users discover and choose the best products for their needs.

**Use this agent when the question involves:**
- Product discovery and recommendations based on user goals and specific requirements;
- Questions about broad categories or regions not supported by specific location-based services;
- Recommendation requests when only general context is mentioned;
- Questions about specific preferences including features, product types, and categories WITHOUT specific location constraints;
- Feature-based or attribute-based queries without location context;
- General questions about the organization's product portfolio, features, services, and details;
- Consultative guidance for product selection and planning;
- Understanding product features, services, and information;
- Helping users clarify their needs through natural conversation flow from intent to preferences to specific product options;
- Loyalty program questions (points earning/redemption, rewards, member benefits, status tiers);
- General service questions (policies, terms, conditions);
- Account-related inquiries (membership status, points balance, history, profile updates);

**Do NOT use this agent when the question involves:**
- Questions asking to FIND or SEARCH for products in specific locations with precise geographic constraints;
- Questions about the AI Assistant and its capabilities;
- Questions about specific agents and their capabilities.
